  - "Kenya ASALs"
  - "disaster risk financing"
abstract: >-
  AgriRisk Kenya is an open-source machine learning early-warning prototype
  designed to forecast county-level acute food-insecurity crisis risk (IPC Phase 3+)
  at 1-, 2-, and 3-month lead times across Kenya's Arid and Semi-Arid Lands.
  Integrating CHIRPS precipitation pentads, MODIS 250m NDVI composites, WFP staple
  cereal prices, and first-order Queen contiguity spatial lags, the system provides
  calibrated decision-support metrics for Forecast-based Financing and anticipatory
  humanitarian action.
